  <item>
    <title>EP12:秋风渐起凉 养生帮帮忙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fb79306c7f8177864ba3f1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fb79306c7f8177864ba3f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 04:23:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>养生不只是老人专利，年轻一代也悄悄加入行列！这个夏天你晒背了吗？闭谷、早睡、维生素，招招新鲜。养生要趁早别等身体响警报，本期跟我们的主播一起聊聊养生的那些事儿吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 包可爱：我现在辟谷第四天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 网吧熬夜与心脏健康：养生的重要性和睡眠时间的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 熬夜到底应该怎么熬？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 养生的智慧：从保健品开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 我成为流感的弄潮儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 阿洋：身体突然的预警</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 腹部疼痛不能忽视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 你属于朋克养生吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 警惕民间偏方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a> 来听听10后的养生经历吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 北方人第一次喝广东凉茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> 山西大哥养生两大法宝：午睡、醋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3153">52:33</a> 生理期我该怎么办</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltExMyZFduIpVR-deJi1UFsj3gZ9.m4a" length="79314569" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7wgtZh7ybcsTMQxA3LVxOFdxDe.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
