    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播:</span></p><span></span><p><span>.张美男:@张美男男男</span></p><span></span><p><span>.秋喜:@单口喜剧秋喜（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span>.包可爱:@包可爱不太可爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>.阿洋:叫我洋不凉</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们聊了聊【工作经历】:选择自由还是面对现实；拥抱生活还是坚定理想？</span></p><span></span><p><span>无所谓，工资会陪你演戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作挺好的，我们只是轻轻破防了...</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏯️你将会听到</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">00:15:10</a> 我在北体学旅游管理，兼职给同性情侣博主写脚本的</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">00:21:55</a> 肄业一点儿不亏</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">00:32:10</a> 见识兼职多样性</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">00:51:30</a> 应聘司机的秘诀是记忆力不好</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">00:54:25</a> 想当演员结果误入传销组织成为金牌讲师</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3842">01:04:02</a> 论工作经验还得看大哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4000">01:06:40</a> 给减肥训练营点儿颜色看看</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4145">1:09:05</a> 必须得批斗的神金领导和奇葩客户</span></p><span></span><p><span>• <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5030">01:23:50</a> 该说不说，还是有点儿高光时刻的</span></p><span></span><p><span>:从这里找到我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>关注公众号【磁场喜剧】，回复「听友群」，添加一起闲聊小助手，进入一起闲聊会客厅~</span></p>]]></description>
